          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They dwell in volcanic craters. According to what is known, a single pair of male and female Magmortar lives in one volcano.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "火山の　火口に　棲む。 １つの　火山には　ひとつがいの ブーバーンしかいないと　いわれる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son bras peut expulser des boules enflammées d’une température de 2 000 °C. S’il en tire trop d’un coup, son bras commence à fondre.",
